{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2022-10-27 07:00:00', 'title': 'THE RITZ-CARLTON, SOUTH BEACH AND THE RITZ-CARLTON, BAL HARBOUR WELCOME NEW MARKET DIRECTOR OF SALES AND MARKETINGBRIGETTE BIENVENU', 'text': 'THE ICONIC HOTELS WELCOME ACCOMPLISHED HOSPITALITY PROFESSIONAL BRIGETTE BIENVENU TO LEAD AND ENHANCE THE MARKETING & SALES TEAM AT BOTH THE RITZ-CARLTON, SOUTH BEACH AND THE RITZ-CARLTON, BAL HARBOUR. MIAMI , OCT. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE RITZ-CARLTON, SOUTH BEACH AND THE RITZ-CARLTON, BAL HARBOUR ARE THRILLED TO ANNOUNCE THE APPOINTMENT OF THE NEW MARKET DIRECTOR OF SALES AND MARKETING, BRIGETTE BIENVENU.'}